---
const pageTitle = "About | Something I Noticed";
const pageDescription =
	"About Something I Noticed, the observations behind the writing, and how the work is made.";

const canonicalURL = new URL(Astro.url.pathname, Astro.site);

const socialImageURL = new URL("/images/site/home-banner.png", Astro.site);

const socialImageAlt =
	"A caveman and cat sitting beside a campfire, overlooking a distant city.";
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />

		<title>{pageTitle}</title>
		<meta name="description" content={pageDescription} />

		<link rel="canonical" href={canonicalURL} />

		<meta property="og:type" content="website" />
		<meta property="og:site_name" content="Something I Noticed" />
		<meta property="og:title" content={pageTitle} />
		<meta property="og:description" content={pageDescription} />
		<meta property="og:url" content={canonicalURL} />
		<meta property="og:image" content={socialImageURL} />
		<meta property="og:image:alt" content={socialImageAlt} />

		<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
		<meta name="twitter:title" content={pageTitle} />
		<meta name="twitter:description" content={pageDescription} />
		<meta name="twitter:image" content={socialImageURL} />
		<meta name="twitter:image:alt" content={socialImageAlt} />

		<link
			rel="alternate"
			type="application/rss+xml"
			title="Something I Noticed"
			href="/rss.xml"
		/>
	</head>

	<body>
		<nav>
			<a href="/">Something I Noticed</a>
		</nav>

		<main>
			<header>
				<p class="eyebrow">About</p>
				<h1>I notice things.</h1>
			</header>

			<section class="prose">
				<p>
					Something I Noticed is where I write about things I
					encounter in ordinary life and follow them wherever they
					lead.
				</p>

				<p>
					Sometimes that starts with cats. Sometimes technology,
					music, cooking, a conversation, or something I was tinkering
					with. I usually don't know where an observation will end
					when I begin writing about it.
				</p>

				<figure class="about-art">
					<img
						src="/images/site/about-caveman.png"
						alt="A caveman sitting at a computer, looking at a photograph of a person and cat on the screen."
					/>
				</figure>

				<p>
					The point isn't to hand you a philosophy or tell you what to
					think. I'm documenting what I noticed, what I thought about
					it, what I tried, and what changed in my understanding.
				</p>

				<h2>How I make this</h2>

				<p>
					I use contemporary tools as part of my creative process,
					including language models for things such as editing,
					research assistance, coding, and working through ideas. When
					generative tools materially contribute to a piece or its
					visuals, I aim to be transparent about that process.
				</p>

				<p>
					The observations, experiences, judgments, and final
					editorial decisions remain my own.
				</p>
			</section>
		</main>

		<footer>
			<a href="/">Back home</a>
		</footer>
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	:global(*) {
		box-sizing: border-box;
	}

	:global(html) {
		background: #0b2118;
	}

	:global(body) {
		margin: 0;
		min-height: 100vh;
		background: #0b2118;
		color: #edf3ec;
		font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}

	nav,
	main,
	footer {
		width: min(100% - 3rem, 760px);
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	nav {
		padding-block: 2rem;
	}

	a {
		color: #a9cbb2;
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	a:hover,
	a:focus-visible {
		color: #edf3ec;
	}

	header {
		padding-block: clamp(4rem, 12vw, 8rem);
	}

	.eyebrow {
		margin: 0 0 1rem;
		color: #8fb59a;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: 0.18em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	h1 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: clamp(3rem, 9vw, 6rem);
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: -0.05em;
		line-height: 0.95;
	}

	.prose {
		max-width: 680px;
		font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.2rem);
	}

	.prose p {
		margin-block: 0 1.5em;
		color: #c4d0c7;
	}

	.about-art {
		margin: 4rem auto;
		max-width: 560px;
	}

	.about-art img {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		height: auto;
	}

	h2 {
		margin-block: 3.5rem 1.25rem;
		color: #edf3ec;
		font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.2rem);
		font-weight: 500;
		letter-spacing: -0.03em;
	}

	footer {
		margin-top: 6rem;
		padding-block: 3rem;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(237, 243, 236, 0.14);
	}

	@media (max-width: 600px) {
		nav,
		main,
		footer {
			width: min(100% - 2rem, 760px);
		}

		header {
			padding-block: 4rem;
		}

		.about-art {
			margin-block: 3rem;
		}
	}
</style>
